- 8) The Name, address and phone number of the person preparing the Application;

- 9) The Name, address, and phone number of the property owner and the Applicant, including the legal name of the Applicant. If the owner of the structure is different than the applicant, the name and all necessary contact information shall be provided;

- 10) The Postal address and tax map parcel number of the property;

- 11) A copy of the FCC license applicable for the intended use of the Wireless Telecommunications Facilities;

